-- C. url  -- NOT APPLIED  (cosmetic: both forms resolve to the same ASIN)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The database holds amzn.to shortlinks; data/books.json holds the direct
-- /dp/ links written by c25a628. SHORTLINK_TARGETS in
-- tools/tests/catalog-links.test.cjs records that each of these shortlinks
-- resolves to the very ASIN the direct link names, so this changes the link
-- form only, not the destination. Skip this section to keep the affiliate
-- shortlinks in production -- but then update data/books.json instead, or the
-- parity test will keep reporting these four rows.

