-- D. cover_image   -- NOT APPLIED
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- LOWEST PRIORITY, AND INVISIBLE TO VISITORS TODAY: catalog.php currently
-- renders no <img> at all -- the catalog is a text-only typographic layout --
-- so `cover_image` is stored but never displayed. Checked on 2026-10-03: the
-- rendered page at books.polascin.net/catalog.php contains no cover URLs.
--
-- The database holds a generated placeholder SVG for every row below. For the
-- twelve listed first, data/books.json has real cover art (Amazon, Gumroad or
-- the publisher), so the database is the poorer copy and would show
-- placeholders if covers were ever switched back on. The remainder are
-- placeholder-to-placeholder differences (regenerated SVG).
--
-- Apply this section only to let the field-by-field parity test reach a clean
-- state; nothing a reader sees changes either way.

